  "description": "In a desolate world left only with extreme cold, a man named Chang-Jo lives alone, bravely and robustly thanks to his innate health. Chang-Jo works as a graveyard keeper in a village emptied by death, using knowledge gained from books to handle various tasks. One day, he discovers Yeon-Hwa collapsed in a snowfield. He picks him up and brings him home... \n\n *“After peeling the chili, you fuse together.”*\n\nChang-Jo does his utmost to save Yeon-Hwa using the knowledge he learned from books (?).\n\n(Source: Bomtoon, translated)",
